Load S3 tags for files only, as the Properties dialog shows them.

LoadFilesProperties asks DoLoadFileProperties for tags whenever a single
entry is selected, a folder too, although the Properties dialog shows tags
for files only. A folder that is only a prefix of its objects' keys -- as
folders made by other tools often are -- has no object of its own to read
tags from: GetObjectTagging answers NoSuchKey, and the folder's Properties
fail. Tags are now loaded for files only. Line counts are unchanged.

--- a/source/core/S3FileSystem.cpp
+++ b/source/core/S3FileSystem.cpp
@@ -1871,1 +1871,1 @@
-    if (LoadTags)
+    if (LoadTags && !File->IsDirectory)
